    "classification": "normal",
    "type": "leader",
    "difficulty": 14,
    "notes": "<h3>Normal | Leader</h3>\n<p><em>A swordsman combining steel and gunpowder to deadly effect.</em><br><strong>Motives &amp; Tactics:</strong> Blast, command, endure</p>\n<p><strong>Difficulty:</strong> 14 | <strong>Thresholds:</strong> 8/14 | <strong>HP:</strong> 6 | <strong>Stress:</strong> 3</p>\n<p><strong>ATK:</strong> +3 | Weapon: Melee/Far | 1d8+4 phy</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>Experience:</strong> Magical Knowledge +2</p>\n<h4>Features</h4>\n<p><strong>Holster - Passive</strong>: The duelist can attack within Far with his gun.</p>\n<p><strong>Blunderbuss - Action</strong>: <strong>Mark a Stress</strong> and target a group within Far. Each target makes a Finesse Reaction Roll or takes 1d8+2 physical damage. You gain a Fear for each target who marked HP.</p>\n<p><strong>Reinforce - Reaction</strong>: When the Duelist&#39;s allies are forced to make a reaction roll, you can <strong>mark a Stress</strong> to give them a +2 to the roll.</p>\n<p><strong>Momentum - Reaction</strong>: When the Duelist makes a successful attack against a PC, you gain a Fear.</p>\n",
